### 智能导诊 - 获取建议
POST http://localhost:8080/api/triage/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "PAT0001",
  "symptoms": ["胸闷", "心悸"],
  "durationDays": 3,
  "temperature": 37.5,
  "allergies": ["青霉素"],
  "history": ["高血压"],
  "attachments": ["base64-自测心率图"],
  "mode": "hybrid"
}

### 智能导诊 - 查询历史记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/triage/history?patientId=PAT0001

### 就诊后评价 - 提交评价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/registrations/REG000123/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "PAT0001",
  "score": 5,
  "tags": ["医生专业", "环境舒适"],
  "comment": "医生讲解很耐心"
}

### 就诊后评价 - 查看评价
GET http://localhost:8080/api/registrations/REG000123/feedback
